g Reddy\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0015\", \"v\": [[\"pics from Nyvoe Rise?\", \"actually, don't bother\", \"in my notes too?\"], [\"I was trying to remember that walk the other week, so could you pull up the photos I took at Nyvoe Rise?\", \"Oh, actually, don't bother with that. I've just realised I don't really need them after all.\", \"Hmm, I've a feeling I jotted something down about it at the time too. Is it in my notes as well?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0016\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you find my files about… about the quote?\", \"ok different thing, what's… what have I got due next week?\"], [\"I need to double-check some numbers before I reply to someone, so could you dig out my files about the quote for me?\", \"Also, while I'm trying to plan ahead and not drop anything, what's due next week?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0017\", \"v\": [[\"I'm having a proper tidy-up and getting rid of old stuff I don't need anymore, so can you delete the bushcraft document for me?\"], [\"Would you mind deleting the bushcraft document, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0018\", \"v\": [[\"umm could you delete the, uh, the fudge document?\", \"oh and, uh, who still has to… who still needs to pay me back?\"], [\"pls delete the fudge document\", \"diff thing, who still owes me money back\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0020\", \"v\": [[\"so umm does anyone owe me cash? like anyone at all?\", \"ok and which of those are, uh, over 25 dollars?\"], [\"Could you tell me whether anyone owes me money, please?\", \"Thank you. Which of those are above 25 dollars, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0021\", \"v\": [[\"I need to log in to something and can't remember the details, so what's the login for the garage backup codes? Not the password, just the login part.\", \"Oh hang on, before I forget, I want to check what I've jotted down lately. Can you show me the notes in my Travel notebook?\", \"Right, that's enough of that for now. Could you show me the actual password this time?\"], [\"Could you tell me the login for the garage backup codes, please? I don't need the password.\", \"Sorry, just a quick one: could you show me the notes in my Travel notebook, please?\", \"Thank you. Could you now show me the actual password, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0022\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please send Jannou a message saying happy birthday?\", \"In that case, could you tell me which documents mention toboggan?\", \"Also, do I have any calendar events about anvil, please?\", \"Could you please bring the wicker photo back from the bin?\"], [\"text Jannou happy birthday\", \"toboggan documents?\", \"anvil events?\", \"restore wicker photo from bin\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0023\", \"v\": [[\"I want to get a card sorted in good time this year, so when is Efua's birthday?\", \"Different thing: I'm hopeless at picking numbers and I've got a new card, so could you just make up a PIN for it?\"], [\"Could you tell me when Efua's birthday is, please?\", \"Also, would you mind inventing a PIN for my new card, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0024\", \"v\": [[\"when's my coffee with Efua\", \"who else is gonna be there\", \"diff thing, can u bump the shibori back a day\"], [\"umm when's my, uh, my coffee with Efua?\", \"and, uh, who else is coming to that?\", \"oh and, um, can you bump the shibori back a day?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0025\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you show me the… the Vromleora router password? like the actual password itself\"], [\"can u show me the Vromleora router password itself\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0026\", \"v\": [[\"ok so can you move the check task to wednesday and, uh, the primrose one to tomorrow?\"], [\"check to wednesday, primrose tomorrow\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0027\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you get rid of every candelabra event? like all of them\", \"oh and, uh, can you find the thornbush receipt?\", \"ok and who's… who is Artemis Machado?\", \"wait hang on, what to-dos have I got on fudge?\", \"ok, um, back to the barber thing: can you set a task to email Machado friday?\"], [\"There's no point keeping any of it in the diary anymore, so could you delete every candelabra event for me?\", \"Different thing: I'm going through my expenses and need proof of a purchase, so can you find the thornbush receipt?\", \"Also, there's a name in my contacts I just can't place. Who is Artemis Machado?\", \"Sorry, random one before I lose the thought, have I got any to-dos on fudge?\", \"Right, going back to the barber. I need to get in touch, so could you make me a task to email Machado friday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0028\", \"v\": [[\"uh can you delete the, um, the toboggan document?\"], [\"Could you please delete the toboggan document?\"]]}","ttft_ms":28533,"type":"result","duration_ms":41663,"uuid":"5421e81a-249b-4023-b2f0-90957e89a55c","ttft_stream_ms":1416,"time_to_request_ms":183,"first_content_frame_ms":1416,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22360901,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278911485.3152,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
